{"title":"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/f/95fdfbb0362c49460ab4b7ef61acc59d3b0fac79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/2219e9890dece9de7055c0f4e57e6d8dda8ad707.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C=90^\\circ.$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> Cevians <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d857b2c804701b561a5c8c90c400f360d27232c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX$\" width=\"29\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed2a785c017799008f04738684e86dba12bfbb28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BY$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and are drawn to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> respectively such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea72f8f21cd1ec617c4a86c0cf83e1a070fd8c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{BX}{CX}=\\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c745bf523c208cb919795bf1f66b400f17581b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AY}{CY}=\\sqrt 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7221c05512bcbbf8f420cd5a4155423c1af8503a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CY=CX-BX$\" width=\"136\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7ae692d898db3164f92a6842981d0c392ef934f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan \\angle APB= -\\frac{a+b\\sqrt{c}}{d},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"197\" height=\"41\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> has no perfect square divisors excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/f/5bf27edd6ee0c25241392922eca9b9c9144f4d73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3bea7cbba4320251df071ca876c849037bd87617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192939ac7d2bcccc913e3eda6ab3431d13ed2652.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import olympiad; size(200); defaultpen(linewidth(0.8)); pair A=(0,6),B=(5,0),C=origin,X=(3,0),Y=A/(sqrt(3)+1); draw(A--B--C--A--X^^Y--B); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,E); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$X$&quot;,X,S); label(&quot;$Y$&quot;,Y,W); pair P=extension(A,X,B,Y); pair D=foot(P,B,C),E=foot(P,A,C); draw(D--P--E,linetype(&quot;4 4&quot;)); draw(rightanglemark(A,C,B,5)^^rightanglemark(A,E,P,5)^^rightanglemark(P,D,B,5)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,W); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,0.5(dir(P--B)+dir(P--A))); [/asy]\" width=\"292\" height=\"335\" />\n</p><p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/7/3d732f32637ea16443e00afb127c65b4d0c50fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CX=3x$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d31e620e75d23d85390e709a0bff006c09a3c89a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XB=2x$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef0e347d63e822847c6dbddfe80077986d578326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CY=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888d7965021d92a815136963360e90df9bef70ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YA=y\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7221c05512bcbbf8f420cd5a4155423c1af8503a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CY=CX-BX$\" width=\"136\" height=\"12\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/4/674ce8149d89b1f87dc2244807b28817bc07c947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3x-2x=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"129\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the projections of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> onto the legs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> respectively.  Remark that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e4ce0d5aee1e32aa9fec78c8d1b281f185d7c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\angle DPB=\\tan \\angle CXB=5$\" width=\"231\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e24979119e364ac4b2f67ca032e9132a595879a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\angle APE=\\tan\\angle AXC=1+\\sqrt3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"275\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b95d491041b3af0047545288603110e60ac1d3bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\tan(\\angle DPB+\\angle APE)=\\dfrac{\\tan\\angle DPB+\\tan\\angle APE}{1-\\tan\\angle DPB\\tan\\angle APE}=\\dfrac{5+1+\\sqrt3}{1-5(1+\\sqrt3)}=-\\dfrac{6+\\sqrt3}{4+5\\sqrt3}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"657\" height=\"47\" />  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/9/e69a4e36656942c5d52232dbe3f2ddf99f0cc2fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB+(\\angle APE+\\angle DPB)=270^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"283\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf1419a232c670d6a0db5e9fc699d07973f47a60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\tan\\angle APB&amp;=\\tan[270^\\circ-(\\angle APE+\\angle BPD)]\\\\&amp;=\\cot (\\angle APE+\\angle BPD)\\\\&amp;=-\\dfrac{4+5\\sqrt3}{6+\\sqrt3}=-\\dfrac{9+26\\sqrt3}{33}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"349\" height=\"97\" /> The requested answer is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/d/8ed26f52c4880e52a2b77a5df9a41e9d3c87c29d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+26+3+33=\\boxed{071}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: